<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-WEST INDIES 30-2 AT TEA V INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES 30-2 AT TEA V INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, trailing by 21 runs on the first innings, were 30 for two in their second innings at tea on the third day of the third test against India on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 298 (S.Chanderpaul 137 not out; V.Prasad 5-82) and 30-2. India 319 (S.Tendulkar 92, R.Dravid 78; F.Rose 4-77).</p>
</text>
